@startuml seq_login
title Sequence: Login and Authentication

autonumber

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #D6E4F0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F0F8FF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor      "User"                   as User
participant "Web Interface"         as UI
participant "Authentication Service" as AUTH
participant "Database"              as DB

User -> UI   : enter email + password
UI   -> AUTH : authenticate(email, password)
AUTH -> DB   : look up the user by email
DB   --> AUTH : account data

alt inactive or unknown account
  AUTH --> UI   : authentication error
  UI   --> User : error message

else wrong password
  AUTH --> UI   : invalid credentials
  UI   --> User : error message

else authentication successful
  AUTH -> AUTH  : verify the password (hash)
  AUTH -> AUTH  : generate the JWT access token
  AUTH --> UI   : JWT token + first-login flag

  alt first login
    UI --> User : redirect to password change
    note right : Access is restricted\nuntil the password is changed.
  else normal login
    UI --> User : access to the dashboard
  end

end

== Next request ==

User -> UI   : navigate the application
UI   -> AUTH : validate the JWT token
AUTH -> AUTH : check the token version
AUTH --> UI  : access granted or denied
UI   --> User : page content

@enduml
